+			// GeneralsX @bugfix Zero Hour Reforged 12/11/2026 This per-frame assignment is
+			// what actually paces the session: timeForNewFrame() derives the wall-clock
+			// step interval from m_frameRate, and it runs after any run-ahead command
+			// value has been overwritten here. It must be the build's logic rate, not a
+			// hard-coded retail 30 -- at 30 the Reforged 60-steps engine (whose step is
+			// half a retail step of game time) advanced at half game speed in LAN games.
+			m_frameRate = LOGICFRAMES_PER_SECOND;
 #endif
